prompt:
[user] Propose a pricing plan for our drone crop-inspection service for farmers in northern Bangladesh. We own and maintain the drones.
Rules: at most 3 charges; all prices in BDT (Bangladeshi taka).

Reply with JSON only, in this shape: {"charges": [{"name": "...", "unit": "...", "price_bdt": 0}], "maintenance_paid_by": "provider or customer"}

[user] Write an incident policy for the course-registration website our student club maintains (6 volunteer developers, 2 of them maintainers).
Rules: at most 4 rules; every rule must say who may trigger it; include one rule for database outages.

Reply with JSON only, in this shape: {"rules": [{"trigger": "...", "action": "...", "who_can_trigger": "..."}]}

[user] Plan how to evaluate our new optional study-skills workshop for first-year students before the faculty makes it mandatory. Students can leave the workshop whenever they want.
Rules: at most 5 steps; no extra budget.

Reply with JSON only, in this shape: {"assignment": "random or voluntary or everyone", "track_students_who_leave": true, "steps": ["..."]}

[user] Write 3 headlines for our CSE department newsletter: our robotics team won the national championship, a new AI lab opens next month, and the library now stays open until midnight.
Rules: exactly 3 headlines; at most 10 words each.

Reply with JSON only, in this shape: {"headlines": ["...", "...", "..."]}

[user] Plan how 300 students enter our exam hall through one door so that everyone is seated within 20 minutes. Seats are in 30 rows; row 1 is next to the door.
Rules: at most 5 groups; every group needs a whole-number entry order.

Reply with JSON only, in this shape: {"groups": [{"name": "...", "order": 1, "who": "..."}]}
